              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1  BRO-2990 · the plugin never starts work, and routed answers carry a hold. The blockers; the conductor needs it first.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ohZ5u",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2  BRO-2995 · reads are pure. Every later count and test depends on reads that do not move state.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "XPrCf",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3  BRO-3001 · needs.list on the server. One count; the Feed, header and push read it.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Y9QLzm",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4  BRO-2999 · Approvals: approval.decide with undo and receipts; Approve on work retired.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "u2Go9",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5  BRO-2996 · the socket verifies its caller; the self-close path goes.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "z3Btmc",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6  BRO-2997 · one writer per store, atomic writes, a cross-process lock.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "QMpmc",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7  BRO-2998, BRO-3002 · client and runtime hygiene, alongside.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EsxqY",
              "name": "t",
              "fill": "$fg-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Design: BRO-3000 · the Pen component library, Lanes in Health, presence, the Ask countdown.",
              "lineHeight": 1.45,
              "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
              "fontSize": 13
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
