                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Two columns: what needs you on the left, what was decided or handled on the right. Cards keep their four rows (kicker, title, action, evidence) so you can judge without opening them. Section captions say what the section is for.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "CbwlV",
              "name": "From Apple",
