                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Maestro's extra rows in Paseo's sidebar (one Maestro row stays, as today) and the presence footer. Maestro's top header holds the tabs (a segmented control), the workspace filter (open here), presence, the next wake, search and New work. Also gone: the single column and the implementation tags.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
