              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MMclH",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Kept from S5",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p0PdG",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "One decision at a time with its cost, why you, three options with a recommendation, the silent default, optional words and where the answer goes. The sort (blocking first, oldest, by ledger), the ledger filter, Up next, and where your last five answers went.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qEUAD",
              "name": "From Apple",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg",
              "cornerRadius": 12,
              "stroke": "$border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qNmHI",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What the touch changes",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uYO7D",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "S5's four answer counters become glance tiles, and \"Waiting to land 27\" turns warn-tinted with a Land them verb: answers stranded on a branch were invisible in S5. The decision is J3's inspector at full width, so answering in the Feed and here is the same act. Progress dots and J / K replace the \"1 of 2\" line.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qoGzg",
              "name": "From Liquid Glass, restrained",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg",
              "cornerRadius": 12,
              "stroke": "$border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ad9LX",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Plugin build",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Irtz3",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "All Views and Pressables; the default countdown is an Animated width; 1–3, ↵, S, J and K are keydown handlers while Maestro has focus. The tile's verb opens the PR that lands the answers (the running app shows it as PR #963); it never merges. No host API beyond R0's frame.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
