                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Kept from S7",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yCbTj",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Dry run and the hourly cadence, Run tick now, Pause fleet, the settings link, the one-line verdict, 48 ticks per scope, the session counts, every notice with what closes it and its one verb, the seven schedules and loops, and the sessions with what the fleet would do and their row menu (…).",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "IzxGN",
              "name": "From Apple",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg",
              "cornerRadius": 12,
              "stroke": "$border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y7Df5",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "What the touch changes",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z8die",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "S7's long strip of counters becomes four tiles you read in one glance: ticks as a 2 × 24 grid, sessions as one stacked bar, schedules as a number, and a new Conductor and lanes tile (S7 had none; A7, A8, A11). Notices and schedules sit side by side as grouped lists; each schedule shows its own 24 h, so a failing pattern is visible, not just a word.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "YT7zw",
              "name": "From Liquid Glass, restrained",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$bg",
              "cornerRadius": 12,
              "stroke": "$border",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 6,
              "padding": 18,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dt1ey",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Plugin build",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "O4zac",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Views only; tick cells and bars are fixed-size Views fed by fleet-ticks and needs.list. Run tick now and Pause fleet go through plugin RPC (dry run stays the default). The row menu uses an in-surface popover, like J1's workspace menu. The scope filter is the header's workspace menu, so S7's own scope tabs are gone.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
