                  "id": "r3ZLyN",
                  "name": "t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "An in-surface View with Animated scale and translate from the button's measured frame; the scrim is a View. Paseo's host Modal is the fallback (a centred card on desktop, a 65 % / 90 % sheet on iPhone), since it cannot grow from a source. Dispatch hands the brief to the lane through plugin RPC.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 13
                }
              ]
            }
