                  "name": "text",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "lVrfF",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$fg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "9 · Undertow marks Running, and nothing else (broomva-design, agentic-work extension)",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "OWxDk",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "A running card wears the contained 4 px halo: pools breathe (4.2 s), the tide runs counter-phase (3.4 s), a faint orbit passes under (9 s). Running rows get the 15 px tidepool dot; Standing gets a quiet pulse. Blue to ice only; never on hover, never on Needs you (that stays Tidepool cyan), never a percentage. Reduced motion: every layer stops and the halo holds still.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "uSwji",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$fg-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Where it shows: J6's Running lane (halo), J1 and J9's Running tile and rows (dots), J7's running sessions (dot and bar), J6's Standing card, J7's broomva lane and J8's driver sessions (pulse). This pass also fixes the earlier misuse of the Needs-you cyan for running dots.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12.5,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rmVhu",
                      "name": "t",
                      "fill": "$fg-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Build: Animated opacity and translate work in a plugin on both platforms. Gradients and blur are not core React Native: on desktop they need web styles through react-native-web (unverified, like backdropFilter in H3); on iPhone the halo falls back to a still blue-to-ice ring of tinted Views, which is the spec's own reduced-motion look.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.45,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                      "fontSize": 12,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
